  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据负整数指数幂的定义和自然数指数幂相除的性质，",
        "得："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$a^{-3}\\cdot a^5=\\frac{1}{a^3}\\cdot a^5=\\frac{a^5}{a^3}=a^{5-3}=a^{-3+5}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "等式 $a^m\\cdot a^n=a^{m+n}$，其中 $a\\ne0$，$m\\in Z$，$n\\in N$，表示整",
        "数指数幂的下述基本性质："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**同底数的两个幂的积，等于这个底数的幂，其指数等于原**",
        "**来两个幂的指数和。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在把整数指数的两个幂的积变形成一个幂时，应用下述",
        "法则是很方便的："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**同底数的幂相乘时，底数不变，指数相加。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了使性质 $a^ma^n=a^{m+n}$ 适合于任何整数指数幂，我们必须取 $a^n=↵\\frac{1}{a^{-n}}$（$a\\ne0$，$n\\in Z$，且 $n<0$）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，为了保持幂的基本性质，对于 $n\\in Z$，$n<0$ 和 $a\\ne0$，有：",
        "$a^na^{-n}=a^{n-n}=a^0=1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，取 $a^n$ 等于 $\\frac{1}{a^{-n}}$ 是必要的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 证明：$a^{-4}:a^6=a^{-4-6}$，其中 $a\\ne0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们有："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$a^{-4}:a^6=\\frac{1}{a^4}:a^6=\\frac{1}{a^4}\\cdot\\frac{1}{a^6}=\\frac{1}{a^4a^6}=\\frac{1}{a^{4+6}}↵=a^{-(4+6)}=a^{-4-6}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上面作变形时，两次用到了负整数指数幂的定义和自然",
        "数指数幂的基本性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，**同底数的幂相除时，底数不变，而从被除式的幂指**",
        "**数减去除式的幂指数。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "51"
      ]
    }
  ]
